  "behavior": [
    "Timeout, abort, overflow and post-spawn error latch the first fixed refusal, clear buffered/late helper bytes and request stop only of the original helper.",
    "The same returned promise remains pending until the original ChildProcess close. A stop request is not cleanup proof. Late exit0 cannot replace the refusal.",
    "Pre-aborted calls and synchronous launch throws with no owned ChildProcess may fail immediately. No-PID asynchronous errors still wait original close.",
    "Existing failed-store handlers therefore cannot start their exact-new-random-record clear before helper close. Existing Companion.poll/Host.stop retain the same promise; no additional activity API or Host/Companion source change."
  ],
